description:
This tender is for the recommission of the adult drug and alcohol treatment and recovery system through one integrated contract with a single accountable provider. The service will:
•	bring together core treatment, prescribing, psychosocial interventions, outreach, recovery support, IPS and agreed criminal-justice treatment/case-management functions;
•	provide a coherent resident pathway with strong harm-reduction, rough-sleeping, hospital, mental-health, primary-care, family, 18–25 and digital pathways;
•	retain formal interfaces with services outside the contract, including Reset Discovery (

To apply, please follow the link and the steps below: 
      
      https://www.in-tendhost.co.uk/quadrant-construction/aspx/Home
      
      o Create an account
      o Click on the tab called &#039;Tenders&#039;
      o Click on &#039;Current&#039; 
      o On the left hand side search bar type in the name of the framework you are interested in
      o Once you have found the framework click on the button called &#039;View Details&#039; 
      o Then click the button called &#039;Express Interest&#039; 
      o Click on the &#039;Selection Stage&#039; Tab at the top
      o Scrol

